rks with business owners.</p><p class="mt-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-paper/70">Written by <a href="/founder" rel="author" class="font-semibold text-paper transition-colors hover:text-gold">Sagar Burse, PhD</a>, Founder &amp; Principal Consultant · Last updated <time dateTime="2026-09-21">21 September 2026</time></p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Your Free Business Systems Audit<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-ink-tint px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold">Talk to SBC</a></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:items-start"><div class="sticky-col"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Choosing a Consulting Firm in Ahmedabad: The Short Answer</h2></div><div><p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The right management consulting firm in Ahmedabad is the one that can show a documented method, real results with numbers, experience in your sector and — most importantly — a commitment to implementation after the report. Start with a low-risk first step, such as a free business systems audit, before you commit to a long engagement.</p><nav aria-label="On this page" class="mt-6"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">In this guide</p><ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><li><a href="#signs" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Signs you need help</a></li><li><a href="#what-firms-do" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">What consulting firms do</a></li><li><a href="#how-to-choose" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">How to choose</a></li><li><a href="#why-sbc" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Why SBC</a></li><li><a href="#services" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Services</a></li><li><a href="#gap360-method" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">GAP360 method</a></li><li><a href="#results" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Results</a></li><li><a href="#who-we-work-with" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Who we work with</a></li><li><a href="#founder" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">The founder</a></li><li><a href="#faq" class="inline-flex py-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">FAQ</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-10"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">SBC at a Glance</h3><dl class="mt-4 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5"><dt class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Firm</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC)</dd></div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5"><dt class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Headquarters</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India</dd></div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5"><dt class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Founder</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Sagar Burse, PhD — Founder &amp; Principal Consultant</dd></div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5"><dt class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Practice Divisions</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">MSME Consulting, Institution Building &amp; Skill Development, Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility, Policy Advisory</dd></div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5"><dt class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Signature Method</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">GAP360™ — Diagnose, Align, Analyse, Design, Implement, Sustain</dd></div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5"><dt class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">First Step</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Free 45-minute business systems audit — no commitment</dd></div></dl></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 border-t border-ink-tint pt-8 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">8+</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Years Of Experience</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">10+</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Consulting Engagements</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">5+</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Institutional Projects</p></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl text-ink">4</p><p class="mt-2 font-medium text-[11px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">Practice Divisions</p></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="signs" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">Signs Your Business Needs a Consulting Firm</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Most owners call a consultant only after the same problems have repeated for years. If two or more of these sound familiar, a management consulting partner can help.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">The founder is the bottleneck</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Every decision, approval and follow-up still lands on you, so there is no time left to grow the business.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">People problems keep repeating</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Unclear roles, inconsistent pay and high attrition mean you keep hiring and re-training the same positions.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Quality, wastage or delivery slips</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Late deliveries, rework and material wastage quietly eat margin and put customer relationships at risk.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-list size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M12 11h4"></path><path d="M12 16h4"></path><path d="M8 11h.01"></path><path d="M8 16h.01"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Nothing is documented</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">With no SOPs, KRAs or KPIs, results depend on individuals and nobody can be held accountable.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-down size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 17h6v-6"></path><path d="m22 17-8.5-8.5-5 5L2 7"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Growth has stalled despite demand</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Orders and enquiries exist, but internal systems cannot handle more without chaos.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">A big decision without proof</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">You are planning an expansion, a new venture or an institution and need independent numbers before committing capital.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 border border-gold bg-gold-wash p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Recognise two or more? Find your most critical gaps in a free 45-minute audit.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint shrink-0 justify-center">Book Your Free Audit<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:items-start"><div class="sticky-col"><h2 id="what-firms-do" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">What Do Management Consulting Firms in Ahmedabad Do?</h2></div><div><p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Management consulting firms help owners, institutions and public bodies solve structural problems that internal teams struggle to fix while running daily operations — unclear roles, missing systems, weak accountability, slow decisions, compliance gaps and stalled growth. A good firm finds the root cause, designs a practical solution and supports the team in adopting it.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Business consulting services typically combine some of the following:</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Business diagnostics and gap analysis</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Business process improvement, SOPs and operational efficiency</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Organisation design, HR frameworks and KRA/KPI systems</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Strategic planning and growth roadmaps</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Feasibility studies, market research and detailed project reports</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Institution set-up, regulatory compliance and policy advisory</span></li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The biggest difference between firms is not the list of services — it is the delivery model. Some firms hand over a report and leave. Others, like SBC, work alongside your team until the new systems are running. Knowing which model you need saves months of time and avoids a report that never gets implemented.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Our article on <a href="/blog/why-msmes-stay-stuck-systems-gap" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">why most MSMEs stay stuck</a> explains how this gap shows up in real businesses, and <a href="/blog/5-business-systems-msme-scaling" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">the five business systems every MSME must build before scaling</a> shows where to start.</p></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="how-to-choose" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">How to Choose a Management Consultant: Six Criteria</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ranking lists rarely show how a firm actually works. Use these six criteria to compare business consulting firms in Ahmedabad on substance — including SBC.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">01</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Implementation, not just advice</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A report is only the start. Ask who will be on the ground with your team after the recommendations are delivered, and for how long.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">02</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">A documented method</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Look for a named framework with clear phases and deliverables. SBC uses the six-phase GAP360™ method: Diagnose, Align, Analyse, Design, Implement and Sustain.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">03</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Proof with numbers</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ask for case studies with before-and-after metrics and timelines, not only testimonials. Good results are specific: on-time delivery, attrition, founder hours freed.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">04</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Relevant sector and regulatory depth</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A manufacturer, a university and a government body need different expertise. Check experience in your sector and with regulators such as AICTE, UGC or NSDC where relevant.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">05</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Senior involvement</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Find out whether the founder or a principal consultant works on your engagement, or whether it is handed to junior staff after the sales meeting.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">06</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">A low-risk first step</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Prefer firms that let you test the fit first — for example a free audit or a scoped diagnostic — before you commit to a long retainer.</p></article></section><p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Hold every firm you shortlist to the same six criteria, including us. If you want to see how SBC answers each one, <a href="/book-free-audit" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">book a free audit</a> and ask.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">For a step-by-step version of these criteria — a full 10-point hiring checklist, the exact questions to ask and the red flags to watch for — see our guide on <a href="/blog/management-consultant-hiring-checklist-ahmedabad" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">what to check before hiring a management consultant</a>.</p></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:items-start"><div class="sticky-col"><h2 id="why-sbc" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">SBC: An Implementation-Led Consultancy Company in Ahmedabad</h2></div><div><p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC was founded in Ahmedabad, Gujarat by Sagar Burse, PhD for organisations that need more than a consultant’s report. Too many MSMEs, institutions and government bodies receive recommendations that never get implemented. We work differently: we diagnose the gap, design the fix and stay engaged until it delivers measurable results.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Today SBC operates four practice divisions — business, institution building, strategic research and policy — serving MSME founders, institutional leaders and government bodies from our Ahmedabad base across Gujarat and India. Read more about <a href="/about-sbc" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">who we are</a> and <a href="/our-approach" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">our approach</a>.</p></div></section><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Implementation Focused</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">We do not leave after the report. We stay engaged until results are delivered and outcomes can be measured.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-check size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Structured Approach</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Every engagement follows a defined method — GAP360™ for businesses and structured frameworks for institutions.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Domain Expertise</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">8+ years across MSME consulting, institution building, strategic research and policy advisory.</p></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-handshake size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4"></path><path d="m21 3 1 11h-2"></path><path d="M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="M3 4h8"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Long-Term Partnership</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">We build lasting relationships, not one-time engagements. Your success is our long-term commitment.</p></article></section></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="services" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">Business Consulting Services Across Ahmedabad and Gujarat</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC’s four practice divisions cover the most common reasons organisations hire a consulting firm.</p></section><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal h-full"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">MSME Consulting</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Systems, SOPs, accountability frameworks, HR and organisation design, change management and strategic roadmaps for manufacturing, trading and service businesses.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/msme-consulting" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal h-full"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-school size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M18 5v16"></path><path d="m4 6 7.106-3.79a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6"></path><path d="m6 11-3.52 2.147a1 1 0 0 0-.48.854V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-.48-.853L18 11"></path><path d="M6 5v16"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Institution Building &amp; Skill Development</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">University and skill-centre set-up, AICTE/UGC compliance, NSDC/SSC affiliation, governance design and curriculum development.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/institution-building-skill-development" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal h-full"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Independent feasibility studies, market research and detailed project reports that validate a venture before capital is committed.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/strategic-research-feasibility" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal h-full"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-landmark size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 18v-7"></path><path d="M11.12 2.198a2 2 0 0 1 1.76.006l7.866 3.847c.476.233.31.949-.22.949H3.474c-.53 0-.695-.716-.22-.949z"></path><path d="M14 18v-7"></path><path d="M18 18v-7"></path><path d="M3 22h18"></path><path d="M6 18v-7"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Policy Advisory</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Policy research, regulatory frameworks and evidence-based advisory for government bodies and industry associations.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/policy-advisory" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article></section></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="gap360-method" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">The GAP360™ Method: Gap Analysis and Business Process Improvement</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">GAP360™ (Growth Acceleration Pathway 360°) is SBC’s flagship gap analysis consulting framework, developed by Sagar Burse, PhD through on-ground consulting with Indian MSMEs. It looks across operations, systems, people, process and strategy, and moves every engagement through the same six phases.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8"><img src="/images/gap360-six-phase-method-sbc-ahmedabad.webp" alt="GAP360 six-phase consulting method used by SBC, a management consulting firm in Ahmedabad: Diagnose, Align, Analyse, Design, Implement, Sustain" width="1600" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-auto w-full border border-ink-tint"/></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-10"><ol class="divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">01</span><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink">Diagnose</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">A structured audit across operations, finance, HR, sales, production and management to identify critical gaps and estimate their rupee impact.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">02</span><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink">Align</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Findings are reviewed with leadership so everyone agrees on priorities before any solution is designed.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">03</span><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink">Analyse</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Root-cause mapping of every gap, producing a prioritised gap register with an impact assessment.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">04</span><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink">Design</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">SOPs, KRA/KPI frameworks, reporting structures and workflows built for adoption, not just elegance.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">05</span><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink">Implement</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Hands-on execution alongside your team — managing resistance and course-correcting in real time.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">06</span><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink">Sustain</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">30-60-90 day reviews, dashboards and performance cadences so results last beyond the engagement.</p></li></ol></section><p class="mt-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><a href="/gap360" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Explore the full GAP360™ methodology →</a></p></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="results" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">Results From Consulting Engagements in Gujarat</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Numbers matter more than adjectives. These business growth consulting outcomes come from SBC engagements and are published in full in our case studies.</p></section><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Manufacturing · Gujarat</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Rubber &amp; Plastics Manufacturer</h3><p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">On-time delivery improved from 61% to 84%, material wastage fell by 18% and annual cost savings crossed ₹15 lakh — delivered in 90 days for a company with 50–60 employees.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/case-studies/rubber-plastics-manufacturer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read the case study →</a></div></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Industrial · Gujarat</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Industrial Components Manufacturer</h3><p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A 3-tier reporting structure with defined KRAs and KPIs freed 12 hours a week of the founder’s time, with the accountability system live in 60 days.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/case-studies/industrial-components-manufacturer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read the case study →</a></div></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Trading &amp; Distribution · Gujarat</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Trading &amp; Distribution Business</h3><p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Attrition fell from 34% to 18% and the hiring cycle from 45 to 22 days after SBC built the HR architecture from the ground up over six months.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/case-studies/trading-distribution-business" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read the case study →</a></div></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Feasibility Study · Ahmedabad</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Finance &amp; Operations Services Venture</h3><p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A 40-day independent feasibility study — including 46 structured SMB interviews across Ahmedabad — sized the Gujarat target market at about 5.6 lakh enterprises and returned a “Feasible” verdict, conditional on pre-launch actions.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/case-studies/finance-operations-services-venture" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read the case study →</a></div></section></div><p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC has also taken an industry-led institute from concept to a credentialed institution — see the <a href="/case-studies/winntus-institute-formwork-technology" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Winntus Institute of Formwork Technology case study</a>, or browse <a href="/case-studies" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">all SBC case studies</a>.</p><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-12"><h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What Clients Say</h3><div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><figure class="flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="flex-1 font-display text-[17px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink">“SBC didn’t just give us a report — they stayed with us through implementation. Our operations improved dramatically within 3 months.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">MSME Founder, Ahmedabad</figcaption></figure><figure class="flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="flex-1 font-display text-[17px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink">“Dr. Sagar’s guidance on institution setup saved us months of confusion. His knowledge of AICTE compliance is unmatched.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Director, Private University, Gujarat</figcaption></figure><figure class="flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="flex-1 font-display text-[17px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink">“The feasibility study SBC delivered was thorough, data-driven and actionable. It gave our board the confidence to proceed.”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-4 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">CEO, Industry Body, India</figcaption></figure></div></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 border border-gold bg-gold-wash p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Want results like these in your business? Start with a free audit.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint shrink-0 justify-center">Book Your Free Audit<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="who-we-work-with" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">Who We Work With</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC is based in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, and works with clients across Gujarat and India.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building size-6 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 6h.01"></path><path d="M16 10h.01"></path><path d="M16 14h.01"></path><path d="M16 6h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 6h.01"></path><path d="M9 22v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"></path><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"></rect></svg><h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Businesses and MSMEs</h3></div><ul class="mt-5 divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-factory mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16h.01"></path><path d="M16 16h.01"></path><path d="M3 19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.769-.422l-4.462 2.844A.5.5 0 0 1 15 10.5v-2a.5.5 0 0 0-.769-.422L9.77 10.922A.5.5 0 0 1 9 10.5V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z"></path><path d="M8 16h.01"></path></svg><span>Manufacturing and industrial businesses</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-store mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 21v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5"></path><path d="M17.774 10.31a1.12 1.12 0 0 0-1.549 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.451 0 1.12 1.12 0 0 0-1.548 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.452 0 1.12 1.12 0 0 0-1.549 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.77-3.248l2.889-4.184A2 2 0 0 1 7 2h10a2 2 0 0 1 1.653.873l2.895 4.192a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.774 3.244"></path><path d="M4 10.95V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8.05"></path></svg><span>Trading and distribution companies</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg><span>Service businesses looking to scale</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><span>Founders trapped in daily operations</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><span>Businesses with HR and accountability gaps</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09"></path><path d="M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05"></path></svg><span>MSMEs planning expansion or new ventures</span></li></ul></div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-landmark size-6 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 18v-7"></path><path d="M11.12 2.198a2 2 0 0 1 1.76.006l7.866 3.847c.476.233.31.949-.22.949H3.474c-.53 0-.695-.716-.22-.949z"></path><path d="M14 18v-7"></path><path d="M18 18v-7"></path><path d="M3 22h18"></path><path d="M6 18v-7"></path></svg><h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Institutions and public bodies</h3></div><ul class="mt-5 divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg><span>Universities and skill-development institutions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-network mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="16" y="16" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><rect x="2" y="16" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><path d="M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"></path><path d="M12 12V8"></path></svg><span>Industry associations and public sector undertakings</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scale mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18"></path><path d="m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7"></path><path d="M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1"></path><path d="m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7"></path><path d="M7 21h10"></path></svg><span>Government bodies that need policy research</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><span>Promoters evaluating a new venture before investing</span></li></ul></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)] md:items-center"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal order-1"><div class="max-w-sm border-2 border-gold p-3 shadow-[12px_12px_0_0_var(--ink)]"><img src="/images/founder/sagar-burse-founder-sbc-ahmedabad.webp" alt="Sagar Burse, PhD, Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC), a management consulting firm in Ahmedabad" width="768" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"/></div></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal order-2"><h2 id="founder" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">Meet the Founder: Sagar Burse, PhD</h2><p class="mt-2 font-display text-lg italic text-ink-soft">Founder &amp; Principal Consultant, Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC)</p><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Sagar Burse, PhD is the Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC), headquartered in Ahmedabad, Gujarat. A strategic business consultant with 8+ years of experience across business consulting, institutional setup, skill development and regulatory compliance, he brings rare multi-domain depth to every engagement.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">He has contributed to the setup of a skill-focused public university in Gujarat, a Centre of Excellence in Mining for a Gujarat PSU, and a private university established by an industry association.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>PhD in Management — GLS University, Ahmedabad</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>MBA in Marketing — Gujarat University</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>UGC-NET and GSET (Management) — qualified 2019</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>7+ published research papers, with SEM/AMOS expertise</span></li></ul><p class="mt-5 font-display text-lg italic leading-snug text-ink">“We don’t leave after the report. We stay until results are delivered.”</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/founder" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View Full Profile →</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsagarburse/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">LinkedIn →</a></div></section></div><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 border border-gold bg-gold-wash p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Talk to the founder directly. The first 45 minutes are free.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint shrink-0 justify-center">Book Your Free Audit<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><style>.faq-item summary{list-style:none}.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq-item .faq-chev{transition:transform .2s}.faq-item[open] .faq-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}.faq-item summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:-2px}main h2[id]{scroll-margin-top:8rem}@media (min-width:1024px){.sticky-col{position:sticky;top:8rem}}</style><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:items-start"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal sticky-col"><h2 id="faq" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem] scroll-mt-24">Frequently Asked Questions About Management Consulting</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tap a question to see the answer.</p></section><div class="space-y-4"><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What do management consulting firms in Ahmedabad do?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Management consulting firms in Ahmedabad help businesses, institutions and government bodies solve structural problems such as weak systems, unclear accountability, stalled growth and compliance gaps. Services typically include business diagnostics, process and systems design, organisation and HR design, strategic planning, feasibility studies and policy advisory. The best firms also support implementation, not just recommendations.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How do I know if my business needs a consulting firm?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Common signs are: the founder is involved in every decision, roles and accountability are unclear, staff attrition is high, deliveries or quality slip, there are no documented SOPs or KPIs, or growth has stalled despite demand. If two or more of these sound familiar, a short diagnostic such as SBC’s free business systems audit will show which gaps cost you the most.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How do I choose the right consulting firm?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Compare firms on six points: commitment to implementation, a documented method, case studies with measurable results, relevant sector and regulatory experience, senior involvement in your engagement and a low-risk first step such as a free audit. Ranking lists of the top consulting firms in Ahmedabad rarely show these details, so ask each firm directly.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What makes SBC different from other consulting companies in Ahmedabad?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC is implementation-led: we stay with your team through execution until results are delivered, rather than ending the engagement with a report. We use a documented six-phase method, GAP360™, publish measurable case-study results, and the free audit is a direct conversation with the founder, Sagar Burse, PhD.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Which industries and clients does SBC work with?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC works with MSMEs in manufacturing, trading, distribution and services; universities and skill-development institutions; industry associations and public sector undertakings; and government bodies. Published case studies include a rubber and plastics manufacturer, an industrial components manufacturer, a trading and distribution business and a proposed finance services venture in Ahmedabad.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How much do management consulting services cost?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Cost depends on the scope, duration and team required, so most firms, including SBC, do not publish a fixed price list. SBC begins with a free 45-minute audit that ends with an honest assessment and a potential path forward. Any further engagement is scoped with defined outcome milestones so you know what you are paying for.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How long does a consulting engagement take?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">It depends on the problem. SBC’s published case studies range from a 40-day feasibility study and a 60-day systems and accountability build to a 90-day full-cycle improvement, a six-month HR architecture project and a 15–20 week institution-building engagement. A full GAP360™ diagnostic typically takes 2–4 weeks.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What is the free business systems audit?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">It is a focused 45-minute conversation with Sagar Burse, PhD. In the first 10 minutes we listen to understand your business, in the next 20 we identify your two or three most critical gaps, and in the final 15 we share an honest assessment and a potential path forward. There is no commitment and no sales pitch.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Does SBC work only in Ahmedabad?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC is headquartered in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, and serves clients across Gujarat and India. Published engagements include businesses in Gujarat, an Ahmedabad-based venture and a skill-development institute with a national scope.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Can a small business or MSME benefit from a management consulting firm?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Yes. SBC’s MSME consulting is built for founder-led businesses, including companies with 25–60 employees where the owner is involved in every decision. Typical outcomes include documented SOPs, clear KRA/KPI frameworks, reporting structures and measurable improvements in delivery, attrition or founder time.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What is GAP360™?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">GAP360™ (Growth Acceleration Pathway 360°) is SBC’s flagship diagnostic and implementation framework. It examines operations, systems, people, process and strategy, and moves through six phases — Diagnose, Align, Analyse, Design, Implement and Sustain — with SBC working alongside your team until results are achieved.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How can I contact SBC or book a consultation?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Book the free business systems audit at sbcgroup.in/book-free-audit, call +91 8128310116 or email consulting@sbcgroup.in. SBC is based in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, and typically responds within 24 hours on business days.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section><section id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 id="cta-heading" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Book Your Free Business Systems Audit</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A free 45-minute conversation with Sagar Burse, PhD. No commitment. No sales pitch.</p><ol class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-3"><li class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-4"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">First 10 minutes</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal">We listen to understand your business</p></li><li class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-4"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Next 20 minutes</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal">We identify your two or three most critical gaps</p></li><li class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-4"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Final 15 minutes</p><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal">You get an honest assessment and a path forward</p></li></ol><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3"><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Your Free Audit<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="https://wa.me/918128310116" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-ink-tint px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg>Chat on WhatsApp</a></div><p class="mt-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Prefer to talk first? Call <a href="tel:+918128310116" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">+91 8128310116</a> or email <a href="mai